[{"id":"part-avl","title":"增加什么约束，才能在更新中限制树高？","section":"avl","role":"section","body":"","goal":"从普通BST的退化进入局部高度条件","activity":"小节转折","withheld_results":[]},{"id":"height-observe","title":"左右子树高度怎样计算？","section":"avl","role":"content","body":"<div class=\"d017\"><p class=\"d17-lead\">约定：空树高度为0，单结点高度为1；非空树的高度按最长根到叶路径所含结点层数计算。</p><div class=\"d17-cols\"><div class=\"d17-panel\"><h3>从树形观察高度</h3><svg class=\"d17-tree\" viewBox=\"0 0 540 355\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"heightA树形\"><line x1=\"270\" y1=\"50\" x2=\"156\" y2=\"142\" stroke=\"#7792ad\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><line x1=\"270\" y1=\"50\" x2=\"410\" y2=\"142\" stroke=\"#7792ad\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><line x1=\"156\" y1=\"142\" x2=\"80\" y2=\"247\" stroke=\"#7792ad\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><line x1=\"156\" y1=\"142\" x2=\"230\" y2=\"247\" stroke=\"#7792ad\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><circle cx=\"270\" cy=\"50\" r=\"27\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#7897af\" stroke-width=\"2.2\"/><text x=\"270\" y=\"58\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#194160\">30</text><circle cx=\"156\" cy=\"142\" r=\"27\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#7897af\" stroke-width=\"2.2\"/><text x=\"156\" y=\"150\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#194160\">20</text><circle cx=\"410\" cy=\"142\" r=\"27\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#7897af\" stroke-width=\"2.2\"/><text x=\"410\" y=\"150\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#194160\">40</text><circle cx=\"80\" cy=\"247\" r=\"27\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#7897af\" stroke-width=\"2.2\"/><text x=\"80\" y=\"255\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#194160\">10</text><circle cx=\"230\" cy=\"247\" r=\"27\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#7897af\" stroke-width=\"2.2\"/><text x=\"230\" y=\"255\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#194160\">25</text></svg><p class=\"d17-note\">根30的左子树高2，右子树高1。</p></div><div class=\"d17-panel\"><h3>自底向上计算</h3><div class=\"d17-formula\">h(v) = 1 + max(h(L), h(R))</div><p class=\"d17-note\">结点20两个孩子都是叶子，所以其高度为2。根30整棵树高3。</p><p class=\"d17-note\">高度描述结构深度，不是关键字的数值。</p></div></div></div>","goal":"建立树高约定与递推理解","activity":"从具体树图推导高度","withheld_results":[]},{"id":"avl-definition","title":"什么是 AVL 树的高度平衡条件？","section":"avl","role":"content","body":"<div class=\"d017\"><p class=\"d17-lead\">AVL 树以 Adelson-Velsky 和 Landis 命名：它首先是二叉搜索树，并要求<b>每一个结点</b>的左右子树高度差绝对值不超过1。</p><div class=\"d17-cols\"><div class=\"d17-panel\"><h3>满足约束的例子</h3><svg class=\"d17-tree\" viewBox=\"0 0 540 355\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"heightA树形\"><line x1=\"270\" y1=\"50\" x2=\"156\" y2=\"142\" stroke=\"#7792ad\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><line x1=\"270\" y1=\"50\" x2=\"410\" y2=\"142\" stroke=\"#7792ad\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><line x1=\"156\" y1=\"142\" x2=\"80\" y2=\"247\" stroke=\"#7792ad\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><line x1=\"156\" y1=\"142\" x2=\"230\" y2=\"247\" stroke=\"#7792ad\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><circle cx=\"270\" cy=\"50\" r=\"27\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#7897af\" stroke-width=\"2.2\"/><text x=\"270\" y=\"58\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#194160\">30</text><circle cx=\"156\" cy=\"142\" r=\"27\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#7897af\" stroke-width=\"2.2\"/><text x=\"156\" y=\"150\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#194160\">20</text><circle cx=\"410\" cy=\"142\" r=\"27\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#7897af\" stroke-width=\"2.2\"/><text x=\"410\" y=\"150\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#194160\">40</text><circle cx=\"80\" cy=\"247\" r=\"27\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#7897af\" stroke-width=\"2.2\"/><text x=\"80\" y=\"255\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#194160\">10</text><circle cx=\"230\" cy=\"247\" r=\"27\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#7897af\" stroke-width=\"2.2\"/><text x=\"230\" y=\"255\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#194160\">25</text></svg><p class=\"d17-note\">根30的左右子树高度为2和1，其余结点也合格。</p></div><div class=\"d17-panel\"><h3>不满足约束的例子</h3><svg class=\"d17-tree\" viewBox=\"0 0 540 355\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"heightB树形\"><line x1=\"320\" y1=\"50\" x2=\"220\" y2=\"142\" stroke=\"#7792ad\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><line x1=\"220\" y1=\"142\" x2=\"121\" y2=\"242\" stroke=\"#7792ad\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><circle cx=\"320\" cy=\"50\" r=\"27\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#7897af\" stroke-width=\"2.2\"/><text x=\"320\" y=\"58\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#194160\">30</text><circle cx=\"220\" cy=\"142\" r=\"27\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#7897af\" stroke-width=\"2.2\"/><text x=\"220\" y=\"150\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#194160\">20</text><circle cx=\"121\" cy=\"242\" r=\"27\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#7897af\" stroke-width=\"2.2\"/><text x=\"121\" y=\"250\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#194160\">10</text></svg><p class=\"d17-note\">根30左侧高2、右侧高0，高差为2。</p></div></div><p class=\"d17-note\">BST顺序条件仍然存在；AVL新增加的是可维护的逐结点高度限制。</p></div>","goal":"明确AVL在BST基础上的逐结点高度约束","activity":"正反例与正式定义","withheld_results":[]},{"id":"bf-calculate","title":"平衡因子 BF 怎样从具体高度算出？","section":"avl","role":"content","body":"<div class=\"d017\"><p class=\"d17-lead\">平衡因子（Balance Factor，BF）是结点的左子树高度减去右子树高度。</p><div class=\"d17-cols\"><div class=\"d17-panel\"><h3>根30的左右子树</h3><svg class=\"d17-tree\" viewBox=\"0 0 540 355\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"heightA树形\"><line x1=\"270\" y1=\"50\" x2=\"156\" y2=\"142\" stroke=\"#7792ad\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><line x1=\"270\" y1=\"50\" x2=\"410\" y2=\"142\" stroke=\"#7792ad\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><line x1=\"156\" y1=\"142\" x2=\"80\" y2=\"247\" stroke=\"#7792ad\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><line x1=\"156\" y1=\"142\" x2=\"230\" y2=\"247\" stroke=\"#7792ad\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><circle cx=\"270\" cy=\"50\" r=\"27\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#7897af\" stroke-width=\"2.2\"/><text x=\"270\" y=\"58\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#194160\">30</text><circle cx=\"156\" cy=\"142\" r=\"27\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#7897af\" stroke-width=\"2.2\"/><text x=\"156\" y=\"150\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#194160\">20</text><circle cx=\"410\" cy=\"142\" r=\"27\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#7897af\" stroke-width=\"2.2\"/><text x=\"410\" y=\"150\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#194160\">40</text><circle cx=\"80\" cy=\"247\" r=\"27\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#7897af\" stroke-width=\"2.2\"/><text x=\"80\" y=\"255\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#194160\">10</text><circle cx=\"230\" cy=\"247\" r=\"27\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#7897af\" stroke-width=\"2.2\"/><text x=\"230\" y=\"255\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#194160\">25</text></svg><p class=\"d17-note\">左高2、右高1，因此根30的BF=+1。</p></div><div class=\"d17-panel\"><h3>由高度建立数值判断</h3><div class=\"d17-formula\">BF(v) = h(L(v)) − h(R(v))</div><p>左侧更高：BF &gt; 0</p><p>两侧相同：BF = 0</p><p>右侧更高：BF &lt; 0</p><p class=\"d17-note\">AVL每个结点都需要 BF∈{−1,0,+1}。</p></div></div></div>","goal":"理解BF符号并会计算具体结点","activity":"具体高度与符号对应","withheld_results":[]},{"id":"bf-every-node","title":"根 BF=0 就一定是 AVL 树吗？","section":"avl","role":"exercise","body":"<div class=\"d017\"><div class=\"course-workspace d17-workspace\" data-course-component=\"task-workspace\"><div class=\"course-input\" data-task-input><div class=\"d17-panel\"><h3>检查整棵树的各个结点</h3><svg class=\"d17-tree\" viewBox=\"0 0 540 355\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"BF树形\"><line x1=\"270\" y1=\"45\" x2=\"140\" y2=\"130\" stroke=\"#7792ad\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><line x1=\"270\" y1=\"45\" x2=\"408\" y2=\"130\" stroke=\"#7792ad\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><line x1=\"140\" y1=\"130\" x2=\"76\" y2=\"225\" stroke=\"#7792ad\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><line x1=\"408\" y1=\"130\" x2=\"470\" y2=\"225\" stroke=\"#7792ad\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><line x1=\"76\" y1=\"225\" x2=\"34\" y2=\"315\" stroke=\"#7792ad\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><line x1=\"470\" y1=\"225\" x2=\"515\" y2=\"315\" stroke=\"#7792ad\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><circle cx=\"270\" cy=\"45\" r=\"27\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#7897af\" stroke-width=\"2.2\"/><text x=\"270\" y=\"53\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#194160\">30</text><circle cx=\"140\" cy=\"130\" r=\"27\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#7897af\" stroke-width=\"2.2\"/><text x=\"140\" y=\"138\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#194160\">20</text><circle cx=\"408\" cy=\"130\" r=\"27\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#7897af\" stroke-width=\"2.2\"/><text x=\"408\" y=\"138\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#194160\">40</text><circle cx=\"76\" cy=\"225\" r=\"27\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#7897af\" stroke-width=\"2.2\"/><text x=\"76\" y=\"233\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#194160\">10</text><circle cx=\"470\" cy=\"225\" r=\"27\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#7897af\" stroke-width=\"2.2\"/><text x=\"470\" y=\"233\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#194160\">45</text><circle cx=\"34\" cy=\"315\" r=\"27\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#7897af\" stroke-width=\"2.2\"/><text x=\"34\" y=\"323\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#194160\">5</text><circle cx=\"515\" cy=\"315\" r=\"27\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#7897af\" stroke-width=\"2.2\"/><text x=\"515\" y=\"323\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#194160\">55</text></svg><p class=\"d17-note\">左、右主子树都高3，因此根30的BF为0。</p></div></div><div class=\"course-task\"><div class=\"course-prompt\" data-task-prompt><div class=\"d17-question\">只检查根30就够了吗？还应检查哪些内部结点？</div></div><details class=\"course-answer\" data-task-answer><summary>核对答案与理由</summary><div class=\"course-solution\"><p>不能。结点20的左子树高2、右侧空，因此BF(20)=+2；结点40左侧空、右子树高2，因此BF(40)=−2。</p><p>根平衡不代表整棵树高度平衡；必须检查所有结点。</p></div></details></div></div></div>","goal":"理解所有结点都必须满足高度约束","activity":"独立预测与核对","withheld_results":["BF(20)=+2"]}]